            "In this section, we highlight some observations made by manually inspecting the trajectories of ReAct agents and ExpeL agents, and by pinpointing possible causes of how some unexpected behaviors might have emerged. Please visit the paper's webpage, \\url{https://andrewzh112.github.io/expel}, for full trajectory demos illustrating the following findings.\n",
